\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 Everything revolves around one immutable domain model:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs26 \cf0 type Inventory =\
\{\
    Computer : Computer\
\
    PhysicalDisks : PhysicalDisk list\
\
    Volumes : Volume list\
\
    USBDevices : USBDevice list\
\
    ThunderboltDevices : ThunderboltDevice list\
\
    NVMeDevices : NVMeDevice list\
\
    NetworkMounts : NetworkMount list\
\
    Filesystems : Filesystem list\
\
    Warnings : Warning list\
\
    Generated : DateTime\
\}\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs24 \cf0 Every collector contributes to this model, and every report (HTML, JSON, CSV, console, Markdown) simply renders it. That keeps the code clean, testable, and easy to extend.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

